  "trends": [
    "Quant is the make-or-break section in Tier 2 (90 marks, −1 penalty)",
    "GA increasingly current-affairs heavy; static GK basics still 40%",
    "Tier 2 English carries 135 marks — highest single weight",
    "Section time-locks mean you cannot borrow time from other sections",
